      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "West Windsor still maps its six historic farming villages—Clarksville, Dutch Neck, Edinburg, Grovers Mill, Penns Neck, and Port Windsor/Mercer.",
